    "updated_at": "2015-12-11T17:02:55Z",
    "body": "That seems reasonable, but I think it's also reasonable to just list them. When we list all form-associated elements, that isn't \"duplicating\" the list of elements defined in \"The elements of HTML\".\n\nPersonally I think it'll be easier if you just list all the ones that impact processing in one place, instead of making people search through #linkTypes. Especially if there are divergences between a and link...\n",
