    "body": "Sorry, the build is still failing. (Are you sure you have the latest build tools?)\n\nIt looks like there is some magic going on I did not realize. You need to do `<code data-x=\"rel-pingback\">` instead of `<code data-x=\"link-type-pingback\">`. I have no idea how the build system figures out that the ID corresponding to rel-pingback is #link-type-pingback, but apparently it does.\n\nAlso, it is attr-hyperlink-rel, not attr-a-rel or attr-area-rel.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
